OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of woman seek answers after
OL,4,ATrinidad death                         
OL,6,FThe family of a former Kent pub        
OL,7,Flandlord who was shot and killed in    
OL,8,FTrinidad and Tobago say they are       
OL,9,Fcontinuing to seek answers after       
OL,10,Finvestigations into her death stalled. 
OL,12,FElaine McGowan, 65, died in the        
OL,13,FCaribbean country in July having moved 
OL,14,Fto the country after running The Castle
OL,15,FHotel in Saltwood, Hythe.              
OL,17,FHer sister, Joanne Butcher, told BBC   
OL,18,FSouth East that despite an initially   
OL,19,Fthorough investigation, efforts to find
OL,20,Fout what happened have proved          
OL,21,Ffruitless.                             
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
