OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of woman seek answers after
OL,4,ATrinidad death                         
OL,6,FTrinidadian authorities were approached
OL,7,Ffor comment, while a Foreign Office    
OL,8,Fspokesperson said it was supporting    
OL,9,FMcGowan's family and was in touch with 
OL,10,Fauthorities.                           
